    {
      "itemId": "cmw235mnm00kd8gz8t82wmy0f",
      "text": "Cutting the trailer storyboard removes work outside the playable-level goal. It reduces scope but adds no evidence of the jump or level."
    }
  ],
  "notDiscussed": [],
  "outsidePlan": [
    "The devlog reports two friends reaching the flag, with one falling into the second pit four times. That addresses the checkpoint’s playtesting question, but no build or test artifact makes the result checkable. The image shows mountains, not the captioned gnome mid-jump."
  ],
  "questions": [
    "Can someone outside the team open the reported level without private access or coaching?",
    "Does the reported level include a working restart, and what caused the repeated second-pit falls?"
  ],
  "direction": {
