      "value": "stalled",
      "why": "The playtest report adds a claim, but no accessible artifact verifies the playable jump or first level."
    },
    "stage": {
      "value": "stalled",
      "why": "The prototype-devlog requirement is marked complete, but this sprint adds no inspectable proof of the core or chosen style."
    }
  },
  "lenses": {
    "marketing": "Devlog #3 told readers that two friends finished the level and received 0 applause and 0 views; no store page or playable link is listed.",
    "team": "Plan against Alex’s 10–15 remaining stated hours, since Mia has not confirmed work for two sprints and her programming capacity is unknown. Across those two sprints, no inspectable playable evidence appeared, so delivery remains dependent on Alex’s confirmed time.",
    "management": "Every task is done or cut, yet none closes public access to the level needed before a demo or release. Use the remaining sprint to publish the reported level with launch instructions, a finish and restart, rather than adding content."
  }
}

